  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HTI008N ACJR Hurricane Melissa-Haiti</narrative>
  </title>
  <description promeva:title="Subtitle" promeva:type="3" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRA Hurricane Haiti</narrative>
  </description>
  <description promeva:title="Description (English)" promeva:type="104" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Haiti ACJR responds to crisis caused by Hurricane Melissa&#xa0;that brought torrential rainfall,&#xa0;flooding&#xa0;and landslides across Southern and western Haiti esp.&#xa0;Grand&#x2019;Anse, Sud,&#xa0;Nippes, Ouest and Sud-Est. Flooding and landslides damaged&#xa0;homes,&#xa0;roads&#xa0;and bridges,&#xa0;prompting evacuations to schools and churches used as temporary shelters.&#xa0;CARE and partner Giradel are implementing WASH and FSL with Protection mainstreamed across all activities targeting the municipalities of &#xce;les Cayemites, Pestel, Corail, Roseaux, J&#xe9;r&#xe9;mie, and Bonbon. WASH actions include hygiene promotion, and awareness raising and water supply, whereas FSL actions include both unconditional and conditional cash support to restore livelihoods, enabling households to meet basic needs and initiate recovery.</narrative>
  </description>
